cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PloidyPatch, please cite the software and the associated paper."
title: "PloidyPatch"
type: software
abstract: >-
  PloidyPatch is a duplication-aware, review-oriented toolkit for preserving,
  ranking, and applying structurally distinct plant gene-model repair
  candidates as auditable and reversible annotation patches.
